<title>VENEZUELA: TABLE-Vencemos 1st half net off.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Vencemos 1st half net off.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p>	Shr			     n/a		    n/a</p>
<p>	Net		26.941 billion     33.623 billion</p>
<p>	Sales	    94.085 billion     95.595 billion</p>
<p>	Cost of sales  54.374 billion     49.483 billion</p>
